  "route": "original",
  "notes": "Backlog game, all-AAA pass: picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year across all genres (docs/PLAN.md section 2, genre filter widened 2026-10-23). Steam app 1151340 was the only app-list match; the Steam schema calls it \"Eagle\" (an internal codename). RAWG's first search result matched the expected slug; RAWG describes it as multiplayer-only. None of the 72 Steam achievements is hidden. RAWG also lists \"Fallout 76: Wastelanders\" (2020) as a separate entry; which achievements came with it is not stated in the data. The Overseer, Foundation and Crater chapter holds achievements 51 to 60 in the Steam list, which name the Overseer, Sofia, Beckett, Foundation, Crater and gold bullion; the later-content chapter holds 61 to 72 (The Catalyst, Daily Ops, The Pitt, the Whitespring Refuge and others), which have low unlock rates (0.7% to 13.3%) like post-launch additions. Both groupings are by list position and names, and \"Overdue Reunions\" (Find the Overseer) and \"Wayward Child\" (The Elusive Crane) were put with the factions chapter as a guess. Several later goals need leading a team (\"Lead and complete\"). StrategyWiki has \"Fallout 76\" at completion stage 0; its Gameplay, Walkthrough, Table of Contents and Custom Nav subpages are linked but not written, so nothing was used. fallout.fandom.com answers the API under \"Fallout 76\" with 500 linked articles (the query limit, so possibly more); names only were looked at, nothing copied."
}
